            "text": "The authenticated Linux arm64 closure matrix passed all eleven checks, and the unchanged 02-text-emoji fixture passed with zero significant regions. Both symbol orders select Noto Color Emoji bitmap ownership; opposite-CSS VS15/VS16, CSS-text, text-symbol, and declared-family controls remain exact, with no tolerance change.",
